# API requests

## 1.Admin

### 1.1 Admin Login
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/login
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": "",
  "password": "",
  "rememberMe": false
}

### 1.2 Admin Signup
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/register-admin
content-type: application/json

{
  "firstname": "",
  "lastname": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 1.3 Admin Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}

### 1.3.1 Admin Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/admin/reset-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "password": "",
  "resetPasswordToken": ""
}

### 1.4 Admin Profile
GET http://localhost:9092/admin/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.data.token}}

## 2.User

### 2.1 User Signup
# @name userRegister
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local/register
content-type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "email": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 2.2 User Login
# @name userLogin
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/local
content-type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 2.3 User Forgot Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/forgot-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "email": ""
}

### 2.3.1 User Reset Password
POST http://localhost:9092/api/auth/reset-password
content-type: application/json

{
  "code": "",
  "password": "",
  "passwordConfirmation": ""
}

### 2.4 User Profile
# @name userProfile
GET http://localhost:9092/api/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{userLogin.response.body.jwt}}

## 3. Content

## 3.1 Student

### 3.1.1 Create
POST http://localhost:9092/api/students
content-type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "",
    "mobile": "",
    "cardId": ""
  }
}

### 3.1.2 List All
GET http://localhost:9092/api/students

### 3.1.3 List with ID
GET http://localhost:9092/api/students/1

### 3.1.4 Update
PUT http://localhost:9092/api/students/1
content-type: application/json

{
  "data": {
    "name": "",
    "mobile": "",
    "cardId": ""
  }
}

### 3.1.5 Delete
DELETE http://localhost:9092/api/students/1

